    {
      "id": "claim_72034f9094134f69b356d7fd7b5c0574",
      "statement": "Florida overlay analysis must keep three authority layers separate: the attached HO/DP contract forms govern coverage, deductibles, valuation, and claims; OIR bulletins govern filed-form, notice, disclosure, and administration requirements; and Manual Rule 500 is internal underwriting guidance rather than an insured-facing regulatory requirement or coverage exclusion.",
