      "statement": "The 2019 Florida HO 01 09 endorsement requires specified advance notice and nonrenewal procedures, including a 90-day nonrenewal notice and roof-related disclosures, and preserves the policy's covered-loss and claims obligations separately from underwriting decisions.",
