      "statement": "Manual Rule 500 contains internal Florida underwriting controls, including roof-age inspection and decline guidance, documentation requirements, and Coverage A appetite thresholds; those thresholds govern internal acceptance, referral, and authority decisions and must not be presented as Florida regulatory requirements or claim exclusions.",
